{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/6","id":4436087541,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSvcS2c8AAAABCGlS9Q","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/6","diff_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/6.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/6.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/issues/6","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/6/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/6/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/issues/6/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/statuses/6e7e16d1b52802d6a3582bf763ef305acd5cd4a8","number":6,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"MAILBOX-0002: deterministic CLAIM and local Codex wake","user":{"login":"pashamango","id":141678664,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHHYSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141678664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- add a bounded dispatcher that re-fetches and digest-verifies immutable MAILBOX-0001 admissions\n- atomically publish one local CLAIM per task id, quarantine changed digests for manual review, and persist run receipts\n- wake the installed Codex CLI through a fixed local preamble with Issue content passed only as untrusted stdin data\n- add an activation watermark, sequential LaunchAgent cycle, and non-destructive MAILBOX-0001 rollback\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v` — 20 tests pass\n- both LaunchAgent plists pass `plutil -lint`\n- `git diff --check` passes\n- Issue #4 immutable admission digest `2cc579b6cedf18f988dc587af38f1cb5f441fa840fe0ed35edd610e4c87719a2` matched a fresh GitHub normalization\n\n## Initial live smoke and root cause\n\nThe first live wake used dedicated R0 Issue #5 (`MAILBOX-0002-SMOKE-0001`). Admission, digest verification, CLAIM, and receipt creation succeeded, but Codex exited before model execution because `$HOME` was not a trusted Git directory and `--skip-git-repo-check` was absent. The dispatcher was corrected to include the installed CLI's documented `--skip-git-repo-check` option and covered by a deterministic test. That failed digest was not replayed.\n\nThe 2026-09-03 follow-up diagnosis found no remaining MAILBOX-0002 chain break: Issue #7 had already completed with exit 0, while Issue #8 was actively executing and subsequently completed with exit 0. The apparent failure was an observation gap caused by expecting GitHub write-back, which is outside MAILBOX-0002. The installed dispatcher had additionally drifted from this branch because MAILBOX-0003 reporter hooks were installed during Issue #8; the minimal repair was to reinstall only `tools/wolfram-agent-dispatcher` from this branch.\n\n## Fresh scheduled end-to-end proof\n\n- LaunchAgent: loaded, `ProgramArguments` runs `wolfram-agent-mailbox-cycle`, last exit status 0\n- source: Issue #10, task `MAILBOX-0002-VERIFY-0003`, R0\n- source digest: `895b9460eca1e02bc5ebb4ab44c1b18e142e36b6d172d9dae4b5e61f9b03f7b6`\n- admitted: `2026-09-03T20:03:24.262992Z`\n- CLAIM: lease `038aeac158714aef8380c201141721ef`, claimed `2026-09-03T20:03:24.903434Z`\n- run: started `2026-09-03T20:03:24.911151Z`, finished `2026-09-03T20:03:56.682583Z`\n- terminal state: `completed`\n- Codex exit status: `0`\n- stdout SHA-256: `c5064dcd21efff85801b388ec81263fc747400ffadc8d22be1f9ffbe59e64bf5`\n- stderr SHA-256: `ab411a57115339a9ab2263ed4a0024dd1c3b0e96be899b4db402529a360bcfb2`\n- real model output reported `/Users/pavelcherkashin` and `codex-cli 0.152.0`\n\nIssue #10 was created once and then processed only by the scheduled watcher and dispatcher. No `--record` invocation or replay was used.\n\n## Rollback\n\nUse the documented rollback in `docs/wolfram-agent-mailbox.md`: boot out the cycle LaunchAgent, remove only the dispatcher activation control file, restore the installed MAILBOX-0001 watcher-only plist from `config/mailbox-0001.plist`, and bootstrap that plist. Preserve all inbox, claim, revision, and run history.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-03T19:06:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T20:08:01Z","closed_at":"2026-09-03T20:07:48Z","merged_at":"2026-09-03T20:07:48Z","merge_commit_sha":"440860e93140bf7dbb97f5f81cb5912ffb3a168a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"pashamango:agent/wolfram/MAILBOX-0002","ref":"agent/wolfram/MAILBOX-0002","repo":{"id":1257706201,"node_id":"R_kgDOSvcS2Q","name":"minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","full_name":"pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","owner":{"login":"pashamango","id":141678664,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHHYSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141678664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango","followers_url":"https://api.github.com